<% content_for :title, "Google account link" %>
<h1>Google account link</h1>
<% if @text_status %><p role="status"><%= @text_status %></p><% end %>
<p>Share this link privately with the person who will sign in to the expected Google account. The link works once and expires in 15 minutes.</p>
<% if @agent_bound %>
  <p>A successful sign-in lets only this agent search the named Gmail account. Google asks for read and compose access; this connector cannot send or draft mail.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>It does not turn on the connector.</p>
<% end %>
<%= label_tag "google-account-start-link", "Link to share" %>
<%= text_field_tag nil, @link, id: "google-account-start-link", class: "input", readonly: true, autocomplete: "off", spellcheck: false %>
